label "Shadow-mode rollout diagram"
box req 16 104 84 44 "live request"
box human 150 40 120 44 "human / incumbent"
box shadow 150 150 120 50 "shadow agent|actions suppressed" acc
box world 330 40 110 44 "real effect"
box sink 330 112 110 40 "effect sink (log)"
box cmp 330 172 110 44 "compare|with human actions"
arrow req human
arrow req shadow
arrow human world
arrow shadow sink
arrow sink cmp
arrow human cmp dashed
note "the agent runs without acting; its proposals are compared with what people did"
